	dcterms:description	"P\u0159edm\u011Btem ve\u0159ejn\u00E9 zak\u00E1zky na stavebn\u00ED pr\u00E1ce je navrhnout a vypracovat realiza\u010Dn\u00ED projektovou dokumentaci, v souladu s n\u00ED prov\u00E9st stavebn\u00ED pr\u00E1ce, a d\u00E1le dodat, nainstalovat, vyzkou\u0161et a uv\u00E9st do provozu horkovod mezi lokalitami Prun\u00E9\u0159ov - Kada\u0148, v\u010Detn\u011B prok\u00E1z\u00E1n\u00ED garantovan\u00FDch parametr\u016F a prov\u00E9st dal\u0161\u00ED stavebn\u00ED a jin\u00E9 souvisej\u00EDc\u00ED pr\u00E1ce.  "@cs ;
